 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/10/03 03:00| 01 | 092| 006| 1854| 0059| 1751| 1861|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/10/03 03:00| 01 | 334| 026| 0589| 0246| 0155| 0792|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/10/02 21:36| 01 | 104| 014| 0733| 0224| 0410| 1121|    \n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/10/02 20:00| 01 | 058| 010| 1836| 0158| 1562| 1954|    \n  <a href=\"CME0017/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0017</a>|2026/10/02 19:48| 02 | 068| 022| 0680| 0586| 0476| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0016/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0016</a>|2026/10/02 19:00| 01 | 358| 014| 035"
